"}, {"type": "text", "content": ""}], "correct_feedback": "Correct!"}}, {"contents": [{"type": "text", "content": "\nInstructions: Complete the following steps. Fill in the Self Assessment.\n"}], "type": "post_instructions"}, {"contents": [{"type": "skill", "content": "Reading"}, {"type": "skill", "content": "Writing"}, {"type": "skill", "content": "Speaking"}], "type": "learning_skills"}], "id": 11}], "type": "scholar", "_data": [{"contents": [{"type": "has_nav", "content": true}, {"type": "has_exercise_controls", "content": true}], "type": "lab_options"}], "id": 0, "stimuli": [{"contents": [{}], "type": "welcome", "_data": [], "id": 0, "template_override": 1}, {"contents": [{"type": "slideshow", "value": {"images": [{"time": "0", "text": "", "id": 0, "image": "engenn11le07ob05re2img01.jpg"}, {"time": "100", "text": "<span class=\"strong\"> Vanessa: </span>\nWell, this is going to be fun! I'm so happy that I can spend the weekend with you two and share my love of cooking and food. If I could take the whole week off, I would be able to teach you everything I know. I think it's really commendable that you are doing this, Peter. You have to be motivated and dedicated to make this sacrifice. If it were easy, we would all have great eating habits and very healthy diets. <br />\n<span class=\"strong\"> Peter: </span>\nAmy will be here soon but we can start flipping through the recipes. She asked if we could make sure we get some dessert recipes too. She's not as strong-willed as I am when it comes to sugar. She also asked whether she could have honey.", "id": 1, "image": "engenn11le07ob05re2img01.jpg"}, {"time": "42000", "text": "<span class=\"strong\"> Vanessa: </span>\tThere are desserts that don't have any refined sugar or dairy in them. They use maple syrup or honey for sweetness. Unlike with coffee, you don't have to go cold turkey on sugar. <br />\n<span class=\"strong\"> Peter: </span>\nOh, good! I feel more gung ho now. . <br />\n<span class=\"strong\"> Vanessa: </span>\nIs Amy going to do the cleanse too? If she could do it with you, it would make it easier for you to stay on track. <br />\n<span class=\"strong\"> Peter: </span>\nShe asked why I was doing it and when I explained that I want to change my habits she got interested. She has a pretty healthy diet but there are some things that she eats too much of. Just bad habits.", "id": 2, "image": "engenn11le07ob05re2img02.jpg"}, {"time": "78000", "text": "<span class=\"strong\"> Vanessa: </span>\nYeah. It's just a matter of recognizing habits and making some small changes. <br />\n<span class=\"strong\"> Peter: </span>\nAmy has lots of questions for you though. She wondered if it was possible to have a cheat day, you know, a day when you can eat whatever you want. <br />\n<span class=\"strong\"> Vanessa: </span>\nWell, if she really needed one, she could have a cheat day. For example, if she were at a birthday party and everyone was having cake, she could have a small piece. It's not good to have cheat days though because they make it more difficult to change habits.", "id": 3, "image": "engenn11le07ob05re2img05.jpg"}], "audiosrc": "engenn11le07ob05re2aud01", "coverimg": "engenn11le07ob05re2img01.jpg"}}], "template_override": 1, "type": "audio", "id": 1, "_data": [], "title": ""}]}]}